(3173204, 444272, 19982, '<td valign="top">It looks like the pink was painted onto the photo rather than being a "revealed color" from the original.  While that''s cool... I just think the sharp edges on the lips is distracting because the edges of the color don''t seem to match the shape of the lips.</td>', 'It looks like the pink was painted onto the photo rather than being a "revealed color" from the original.  While that''s cool... I just think the sharp edges on the lips is distracting because the edges of the color don''t seem to match the shape of the lips.', '2007-01-03 00:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3173213, 445151, 65106, '<td valign="top">Wow ... a great idea. Lighting is too hot top right and bottom left, and the background is too busy (the lines should not be there, but if they have to be, they should be perfectly horizontal.)</td>', 'Wow ... a great idea. Lighting is too hot top right and bottom left, and the background is too busy (the lines should not be there, but if they have to be, they should be perfectly horizontal.)', '2007-01-03 00:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
