(3173741, 445706, 66201, '<td valign="top">Incredible photo location...I find there to be a lack of drama/story/interest in your composition though. The tones,hues,textures are lovely, but the posed figure is just un-exciting. If he had been moving,dancing, in a different - dramatic pose (eg prostrate on the ground) it may have added to the general interest factor.</td>', 'Incredible photo location...I find there to be a lack of drama/story/interest in your composition though. The tones,hues,textures are lovely, but the posed figure is just un-exciting. If he had been moving,dancing, in a different - dramatic pose (eg prostrate on the ground) it may have added to the general interest factor.', '2007-01-03 03:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3173743, 443894, 69121, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot but I think too many people are confusing Centered Composition with fillind the whole frame. You could''ve at least cropped it so that the head was in the middle.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot but I think too many people are confusing Centered Composition with fillind the whole frame. You could''ve at least cropped it so that the head was in the middle.', '2007-01-03 03:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
