(3178526, 446306, 70308, '<td valign="top">I really like what you''ve done here, the color saturation, the negative space around the "expanded" droplet and the dof blur all work to create a great composition.  It also looks like a glow is on the center which add to the lighting on that section - although I can''t tell if that section is even real which makes the editing job even better.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'I really like what you''ve done here, the color saturation, the negative space around the "expanded" droplet and the dof blur all work to create a great composition.  It also looks like a glow is on the center which add to the lighting on that section - although I can''t tell if that section is even real which makes the editing job even better.  Thanks for sharing.', '2007-01-03 23:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178527, 444904, 63503, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture indeed, I just wished the jet trail would have not been there (8)</td>', 'Very nice picture indeed, I just wished the jet trail would have not been there (8)', '2007-01-03 23:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
