(3179957, 446475, 48471, '<td valign="top">6 A great pose, a very good composition, which fits naturally. Although centered, the photo is still dynamic. But, there´s something very wrong with the light and the colours here that I can´t really put my finger at. Have you tried a black and white version? I think it would definitely work much better. Pushing, really pushing hard to a 6.</td>', '6 A great pose, a very good composition, which fits naturally. Although centered, the photo is still dynamic. But, there´s something very wrong with the light and the colours here that I can´t really put my finger at. Have you tried a black and white version? I think it would definitely work much better. Pushing, really pushing hard to a 6.', '2007-01-04 09:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
