(3179979, 446530, 48471, '<td valign="top">5 Good idea and well justified centered composition. But the lights and the colours are so bad. Wonderful smiles though, so pushing for a 5.</td>', '5 Good idea and well justified centered composition. But the lights and the colours are so bad. Wonderful smiles though, so pushing for a 5.', '2007-01-04 10:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
