(3183047, 446734, 67697, '<td valign="top">LOL - good caption.  I know you may not have been able to do much about it, but the green stuff is a distraction, mostly because it hangs to the left and below the back tail of the fish.</td>', 'LOL - good caption.  I know you may not have been able to do much about it, but the green stuff is a distraction, mostly because it hangs to the left and below the back tail of the fish.', '2007-01-04 22:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183057, 445680, 67697, '<td valign="top">To me this is centered, but it doesn''t really grab my attention.  It would have been cool to see some back lighting (highlight the lamp, darken the wall), and have the lamp lit so that you have more emphasis on just the lamp and not lamp AND wall.</td>', 'To me this is centered, but it doesn''t really grab my attention.  It would have been cool to see some back lighting (highlight the lamp, darken the wall), and have the lamp lit so that you have more emphasis on just the lamp and not lamp AND wall.', '2007-01-04 22:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
