(3184334, 444890, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is such a powerful photograph .. the subject of course, but the combination of the subject and the other elements as well ... the black &amp; white, the dramatic sky and the stark branches and the perspective that leads your eye even more so to the subject ... <br/>the more i look at this photograph the more i see it is a work of art ... <br/>looking at this lady i''m struck by the differences in ppl''s lives and what hardships some ppl endure ...  my prayers are with her ... =10</td>', 'this is such a powerful photograph .. the subject of course, but the combination of the subject and the other elements as well ... the black & white, the dramatic sky and the stark branches and the perspective that leads your eye even more so to the subject ... the more i look at this photograph the more i see it is a work of art ... looking at this lady i''m struck by the differences in ppl''s lives and what hardships some ppl endure ...  my prayers are with her ... =10', '2007-01-05 09:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
