(3184666, 446115, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is cute.  I''ll bet you had a few giggles taking it.  :D  Something about the lighting or processing is strange (IMO) with this photo.  The skin looks too yellowish.  It''s almost like you went down a sepia path but didn''t quite get all the way there.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is cute.  I''ll bet you had a few giggles taking it.  :D  Something about the lighting or processing is strange (IMO) with this photo.  The skin looks too yellowish.  It''s almost like you went down a sepia path but didn''t quite get all the way there.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-01-05 11:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184677, 446762, 30049, '<td valign="top">Last hurrah of the holiday season?  :D  The snowman looks great, as does most of the surrounding vicinity.  You may have been better off just leaving the light in the upper left overexposed.  The slight <strike>dodging</strike> on it just draws attention to it IMO and doesn''t match the rest of the photo.<br/> <br/>edit: Oops!  I meant burning, not dodging.  :/<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-10 09:11:38.</i></td>', 'Last hurrah of the holiday season?  :D  The snowman looks great, as does most of the surrounding vicinity.  You may have been better off just leaving the light in the upper left overexposed.  The slight dodging on it just draws attention to it IMO and doesn''t match the rest of the photo. edit: Oops!  I meant burning, not dodging.  :/', '2007-01-05 11:42:47.000000', '2007-01-10 09:11:38.000000', 1),
