(3184703, 444508, 30049, '<td valign="top">Have you read "<i>Watership Down</i>"?  Perhaps then you''d see it the other way around.  :D<br/> <br/>This is very cute rabbit.  Family pet I take it?  Decent photo as it is.  Being an advanced challenge you may have considered some light burning of the perimeter to draw the eye to center.  Especially in the areas above the rabbit.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Have you read "Watership Down"?  Perhaps then you''d see it the other way around.  :D This is very cute rabbit.  Family pet I take it?  Decent photo as it is.  Being an advanced challenge you may have considered some light burning of the perimeter to draw the eye to center.  Especially in the areas above the rabbit. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-05 11:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
