(3184885, 446277, 30049, '<td valign="top">Overall, I like the photo - however, it''s not really centered.  Could have easily cropped it square to make it work. ???  Did you have anyone available to work the lights in the cabin?  Would have been good to have someone turn them off 1 or 2 seconds after the shutter was activated.  Just a thought to keep the lights from being overexposed.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Overall, I like the photo - however, it''s not really centered.  Could have easily cropped it square to make it work. ???  Did you have anyone available to work the lights in the cabin?  Would have been good to have someone turn them off 1 or 2 seconds after the shutter was activated.  Just a thought to keep the lights from being overexposed.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-05 13:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184894, 446642, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the way you used the trees for framing.  For some reason her face doesn''t really jump out here.  Is it the surrounding color inside the hood maybe?  Hard to explain, it seems like her face isn''t "bright" enough - not necessarily exposure.  Need that gleem in her eyes...maybe not sharp enough?  Sorry for the questions.  Just kind of thinking out loud.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the way you used the trees for framing.  For some reason her face doesn''t really jump out here.  Is it the surrounding color inside the hood maybe?  Hard to explain, it seems like her face isn''t "bright" enough - not necessarily exposure.  Need that gleem in her eyes...maybe not sharp enough?  Sorry for the questions.  Just kind of thinking out loud.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-05 13:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
