(3187395, 445421, 66201, '<td valign="top">I just love these little fellows: but wouldn''t call him "self-centred" since his position is one of duty to others ...being the lookout. These little critters take it in turns to share the role of lookout for the good of the whole colony...watching for predators. If one is spotted they give the alarm call. Really risk their own lives for the benefit of the others every time they go on duty.<br/> <br/>Beautifully captured nevertheless and good control of post processing.</td>', 'I just love these little fellows: but wouldn''t call him "self-centred" since his position is one of duty to others ...being the lookout. These little critters take it in turns to share the role of lookout for the good of the whole colony...watching for predators. If one is spotted they give the alarm call. Really risk their own lives for the benefit of the others every time they go on duty. Beautifully captured nevertheless and good control of post processing.', '2007-01-06 03:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
