(3190602, 443587, 64086, '<td valign="top">Nice looking dog. I think a tighter crop to eliminate the washed out sky and the grass sticking up on the righthand side would greatly improve this photo. Also, the head is partly infront of a similarly colored object causing it to lose separation from the background.</td>', 'Nice looking dog. I think a tighter crop to eliminate the washed out sky and the grass sticking up on the righthand side would greatly improve this photo. Also, the head is partly infront of a similarly colored object causing it to lose separation from the background.', '2007-01-07 05:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190753, 446631, 24613, '<td valign="top">Lighthouses are my favorite subjects and this is one of the BEST shots I''ve seen!  So clear for a night shot.  The stars are great!  Very good job! 10</td>', 'Lighthouses are my favorite subjects and this is one of the BEST shots I''ve seen!  So clear for a night shot.  The stars are great!  Very good job! 10', '2007-01-07 07:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190760, 446602, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  I love the negative space from the white backdrop.  Nice work!</td>', 'Very creative.  I love the negative space from the white backdrop.  Nice work!', '2007-01-07 07:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190762, 446409, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very nice! 9</td>', 'Very nice! 9', '2007-01-07 07:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190763, 446558, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro shot.  Love the way the focus is on the rim of the flask and the bottom is blurred.  Nice work!</td>', 'Very nice macro shot.  Love the way the focus is on the rim of the flask and the bottom is blurred.  Nice work!', '2007-01-07 07:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190774, 446368, 509, '<td valign="top">I think this would benefit from some more contrast. Since changing the background probably isn''t possible, I''d burn it in a little or change the saturation - just something to put more emphasis on the gecko as the subject.  Here the area with the most contrast is the line between the shade and the light, which draws my attention more than the gecko.</td>', 'I think this would benefit from some more contrast. Since changing the background probably isn''t possible, I''d burn it in a little or change the saturation - just something to put more emphasis on the gecko as the subject.  Here the area with the most contrast is the line between the shade and the light, which draws my attention more than the gecko.', '2007-01-07 07:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190778, 446210, 509, '<td valign="top">Fishing bobber?  I like the post processing.  I think this could really stand out if the bobber had a bright red stripe on it as most I''ve seen do (of course then you probably wouldn''t be keeping true to the scene), but the bright color against the dark and weathered background would add to the story here imho.</td>', 'Fishing bobber?  I like the post processing.  I think this could really stand out if the bobber had a bright red stripe on it as most I''ve seen do (of course then you probably wouldn''t be keeping true to the scene), but the bright color against the dark and weathered background would add to the story here imho.', '2007-01-07 08:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190782, 443691, 509, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this is a little too abstract for my taste.  There''s no subject and barely any textures here.</td>', 'Sorry, but this is a little too abstract for my taste.  There''s no subject and barely any textures here.', '2007-01-07 08:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190789, 445226, 509, '<td valign="top">Would have more impact if his eyes were in focus (imho).  Good bokeh in the background.</td>', 'Would have more impact if his eyes were in focus (imho).  Good bokeh in the background.', '2007-01-07 08:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190795, 446089, 509, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and composition!  Looks like piano music to me though = )  There''s a couple of low notes on the melody out of the Eb Alto range unless you''re transposing.</td>', 'Great lighting and composition!  Looks like piano music to me though = )  There''s a couple of low notes on the melody out of the Eb Alto range unless you''re transposing.', '2007-01-07 08:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190797, 444325, 509, '<td valign="top">Very sharp with nice textures and contrast.</td>', 'Very sharp with nice textures and contrast.', '2007-01-07 08:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
