(3192956, 446371, 1128, '<td valign="top">The subject of this photo does not inspire me at all, I''m afraid.   Try getting in closer, maybe by that moss on the right bottom corner, and see if anything interesting pops up.  There <b>must</b> be something more interesting in that area than a pile of dead leaves.</td>', 'The subject of this photo does not inspire me at all, I''m afraid.   Try getting in closer, maybe by that moss on the right bottom corner, and see if anything interesting pops up.  There must be something more interesting in that area than a pile of dead leaves.', '2007-01-07 20:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3192958, 445140, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty image. Glad only part of her profile is showing. I like the peek of pink.</td>', 'This is a very pretty image. Glad only part of her profile is showing. I like the peek of pink.', '2007-01-07 20:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3192959, 444487, 1128, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast.</td>', 'Nice contrast.', '2007-01-07 20:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3192966, 446746, 1128, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this.  In a sea of awful photos of centered NOTHING, here is a beautiful, graceful image.  Nice lighting and composition.  Best of luck.</td>', 'I absolutely love this.  In a sea of awful photos of centered NOTHING, here is a beautiful, graceful image.  Nice lighting and composition.  Best of luck.', '2007-01-07 20:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3192975, 446530, 1128, '<td valign="top">Cuties!  The color seems way off here.  Did you check white balance, hue, saturation and levels?</td>', 'Cuties!  The color seems way off here.  Did you check white balance, hue, saturation and levels?', '2007-01-07 20:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193110, 446756, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s the use of the primary colors that makes your image work for me. Good eye.</td>', 'It''s the use of the primary colors that makes your image work for me. Good eye.', '2007-01-07 21:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193212, 446551, 18799, '<td valign="top">While this is a beautiful photo, I don''t really see it as centered.  In portrature, the eyes are the focal point, and these are more closely following the "rule of thirds".  I''m give this a 5 because of that.  In a portrait challenge it would have been a 8 or 9</td>', 'While this is a beautiful photo, I don''t really see it as centered.  In portrature, the eyes are the focal point, and these are more closely following the "rule of thirds".  I''m give this a 5 because of that.  In a portrait challenge it would have been a 8 or 9', '2007-01-07 22:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193225, 445218, 6519, '<td valign="top">This would be way better without the cars there, but I did get it (thanks to the title).</td>', 'This would be way better without the cars there, but I did get it (thanks to the title).', '2007-01-07 22:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193229, 446745, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but I would have like it better without the candle.  The candle ruins the centered symmetry effect.   I''m giving this an 8.  Without the candle this would have been a strong 10.</td>', 'This is nice, but I would have like it better without the candle.  The candle ruins the centered symmetry effect.   I''m giving this an 8.  Without the candle this would have been a strong 10.', '2007-01-07 22:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193230, 446766, 61012, '<td valign="top">A little to dark for me. Nice composition though</td>', 'A little to dark for me. Nice composition though', '2007-01-07 22:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193235, 446136, 61012, '<td valign="top">The fireworks draw the eye away from the center defeating the "centered: concept.</td>', 'The fireworks draw the eye away from the center defeating the "centered: concept.', '2007-01-07 22:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193237, 446644, 61012, '<td valign="top">I really like the way my eye is drawn to the opening. Nicely done!</td>', 'I really like the way my eye is drawn to the opening. Nicely done!', '2007-01-07 22:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
