(3193279, 446255, 18799, '<td valign="top">Very simple and eligant.  I think I would have cloned out the specks since this is advanced edit.  The border works.  9</td>', 'Very simple and eligant.  I think I would have cloned out the specks since this is advanced edit.  The border works.  9', '2007-01-07 22:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193290, 443597, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait of him. Would like to see him a little sharper, though. 6.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait of him. Would like to see him a little sharper, though. 6.', '2007-01-07 22:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193294, 444006, 66597, '<td valign="top">The color temperature seems to warm on this, but I like the creativity of this shot.</td>', 'The color temperature seems to warm on this, but I like the creativity of this shot.', '2007-01-07 22:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193296, 446699, 6519, '<td valign="top">With this range of distance (very close to very far), I would have thought that at least ONE little part must be in focus, even by accident. I was wrong.<br/>Did you have the camera set to macro?</td>', 'With this range of distance (very close to very far), I would have thought that at least ONE little part must be in focus, even by accident. I was wrong.Did you have the camera set to macro?', '2007-01-07 22:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193300, 443938, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great perspective!</td>', 'Great perspective!', '2007-01-07 22:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193320, 444487, 61755, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W photo</td>', 'Nice B&W photo', '2007-01-07 22:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193327, 446546, 33400, '<td valign="top">I''m staring and staring.  I keep waiting to vote on this one because I can''t decide what I think of it.  I think I''ve figured it out, but I''m still pondering the excess blur on the train as well as the tracks up close. I guess I like it.  The colors and balance are superlative and the subject is well centered although I wasn''t sure what the subject was for a while. Gotta move on so I''ll vote now.  Nice job.</td>', 'I''m staring and staring.  I keep waiting to vote on this one because I can''t decide what I think of it.  I think I''ve figured it out, but I''m still pondering the excess blur on the train as well as the tracks up close. I guess I like it.  The colors and balance are superlative and the subject is well centered although I wasn''t sure what the subject was for a while. Gotta move on so I''ll vote now.  Nice job.', '2007-01-07 22:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193329, 445658, 61755, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed your creative take on the theme...good use of leading lines &amp; color.</td>', 'I enjoyed your creative take on the theme...good use of leading lines & color.', '2007-01-07 22:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193337, 445102, 61755, '<td valign="top">Cute! I like the warmth of the photo and that the face is sharp.</td>', 'Cute! I like the warmth of the photo and that the face is sharp.', '2007-01-07 23:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193344, 443979, 33400, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot.  I wish you had made it a bit bigger.</td>', 'Stunning shot.  I wish you had made it a bit bigger.', '2007-01-07 23:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193354, 444687, 33400, '<td valign="top">Looks like you shot this througha window or glass door.  I think you could have cloned out the streak and smear at the top since it''s advanced editing.  Still a very good shot.</td>', 'Looks like you shot this througha window or glass door.  I think you could have cloned out the streak and smear at the top since it''s advanced editing.  Still a very good shot.', '2007-01-07 23:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193365, 446145, 33400, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I think (not sure) that in advanced editing you could bring down the brightness of the tent - it''s a little distracting.</td>', 'Great capture.  I think (not sure) that in advanced editing you could bring down the brightness of the tent - it''s a little distracting.', '2007-01-07 23:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193380, 446588, 33400, '<td valign="top">An excellent color study and the lines lead well to the center.</td>', 'An excellent color study and the lines lead well to the center.', '2007-01-07 23:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193410, 446516, 33400, '<td valign="top">Simple and appealing - just enough with the plain background.  Well done.</td>', 'Simple and appealing - just enough with the plain background.  Well done.', '2007-01-07 23:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193419, 446422, 33400, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  The balance and light is wonderful. If I were to knit-pick anything, I''d suggest losing (cloning) the red bouy floating in the back left.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  The balance and light is wonderful. If I were to knit-pick anything, I''d suggest losing (cloning) the red bouy floating in the back left.', '2007-01-07 23:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193432, 446751, 33400, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition.  The simplicity here- not overdone as the fingers are relaxed and natural, along with the grain felt by the sand rather than post processing makes this exceptional. Good tone and lighting also. <br/>To pick a little just so you know I''m looking, I think the lighting on the outer edge of the thumb could be softened a bit. But I had to look for it...</td>', 'Wonderful composition.  The simplicity here- not overdone as the fingers are relaxed and natural, along with the grain felt by the sand rather than post processing makes this exceptional. Good tone and lighting also. To pick a little just so you know I''m looking, I think the lighting on the outer edge of the thumb could be softened a bit. But I had to look for it...', '2007-01-07 23:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193444, 444362, 33400, '<td valign="top">Please understand that I''m not a cat person, and cat''s aren''t fond of me either.  Plus there are an inordinate amount of felines in this challenge. <br/>..That said, This is far and away the best cat shot I''ve seen and I am happy to rate this in my top picks for the challenge.<br/>Beautiful expression and excellent detail. You did not appear to need the ubsharp mask to bring out the fine edges.  Well done.</td>', 'Please understand that I''m not a cat person, and cat''s aren''t fond of me either.  Plus there are an inordinate amount of felines in this challenge. ..That said, This is far and away the best cat shot I''ve seen and I am happy to rate this in my top picks for the challenge.Beautiful expression and excellent detail. You did not appear to need the ubsharp mask to bring out the fine edges.  Well done.', '2007-01-07 23:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3193452, 445855, 33400, '<td valign="top">If Dali were a photographer, he''d look for this kind of setting.  I want to see more.  Well done.</td>', 'If Dali were a photographer, he''d look for this kind of setting.  I want to see more.  Well done.', '2007-01-07 23:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
