(3195871, 446078, 71620, '<td valign="top">strange DOF choice. I would have preferred the entire stalk to be in focus</td>', 'strange DOF choice. I would have preferred the entire stalk to be in focus', '2007-01-08 12:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3195877, 446337, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and DOF on this portrait.  I''m not getting the feel of this being especially centered.  The lower hand, upward leaning arm, and her face, all create a diagonal that pulls the viewer from off-center left to the lower-right.  A little more space horizontally, and less vertically is needed IMO.  Those are just challenge technicalities I suppose.  Wonderful image nonetheless and one that any parent would be pleased to have.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great clarity and DOF on this portrait.  I''m not getting the feel of this being especially centered.  The lower hand, upward leaning arm, and her face, all create a diagonal that pulls the viewer from off-center left to the lower-right.  A little more space horizontally, and less vertically is needed IMO.  Those are just challenge technicalities I suppose.  Wonderful image nonetheless and one that any parent would be pleased to have.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-08 12:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3195973, 445658, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  I''m jealous.  Jealous in that I didn''t think of this first!  :D  This is fun, creative, simple, clean...all good ingredients for a fine challenge entry.  That spoon creates the perfect leading line right to the marbles and the fork tines bounce the viewer right back to the marbles if you dare stray.<br/> <br/>Did I mention that I like this?  :D  Look to see you on the front page when the voting is over.  Well done!</td>', 'Ok.  I''m jealous.  Jealous in that I didn''t think of this first!  :D  This is fun, creative, simple, clean...all good ingredients for a fine challenge entry.  That spoon creates the perfect leading line right to the marbles and the fork tines bounce the viewer right back to the marbles if you dare stray. Did I mention that I like this?  :D  Look to see you on the front page when the voting is over.  Well done!', '2007-01-08 12:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196065, 446475, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Love how his/her ears flop as s/he bounds ahead!</td>', 'Great capture!  Love how his/her ears flop as s/he bounds ahead!', '2007-01-08 13:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
