(3196235, 446330, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Nothing personal, but this doesn''t seem that ''centered'' to me, and the most interesting part of the photo is the top of the building which takes the viewer far from the center of the image.  Also seems a bit underexposed - could be the weather, but appears a little dark.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Nothing personal, but this doesn''t seem that ''centered'' to me, and the most interesting part of the photo is the top of the building which takes the viewer far from the center of the image.  Also seems a bit underexposed - could be the weather, but appears a little dark.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-08 14:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
