(3196251, 444696, 41337, '<td valign="top">Maybe you should have called this "Stop"? Lots of red happening here which seems to indicate that. I would have loved to see the bus more to the right so that it appeared to be in front of the cop rather than directly behind it. That would have made this juxtapose more interesting, IMO.</td>', 'Maybe you should have called this "Stop"? Lots of red happening here which seems to indicate that. I would have loved to see the bus more to the right so that it appeared to be in front of the cop rather than directly behind it. That would have made this juxtapose more interesting, IMO.', '2007-01-08 14:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
