(3196273, 446546, 41337, '<td valign="top">I assume those are train tracks? I''m not really sure I get what you''re trying to do here with the DOF or the subject matter. What is in focus just doesn''t seem interesting to me. On the positive, I do like the way you composed the elements into the frame. I think it works well centered.</td>', 'I assume those are train tracks? I''m not really sure I get what you''re trying to do here with the DOF or the subject matter. What is in focus just doesn''t seem interesting to me. On the positive, I do like the way you composed the elements into the frame. I think it works well centered.', '2007-01-08 14:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196277, 445707, 66515, '<td valign="top">Ouch...Don''t care for the processing here.</td>', 'Ouch...Don''t care for the processing here.', '2007-01-08 14:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
