(3196285, 444685, 41337, '<td valign="top">Quality image. For me I would have liked to see more shadows and detail but I understand it''s more about the necklace than the model in this shot.</td>', 'Quality image. For me I would have liked to see more shadows and detail but I understand it''s more about the necklace than the model in this shot.', '2007-01-08 14:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196287, 444487, 41337, '<td valign="top">As I said before I love to the tones in this. Very high quality b/w imag here.</td>', 'As I said before I love to the tones in this. Very high quality b/w imag here.', '2007-01-08 14:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196296, 446315, 66515, '<td valign="top">too small by half!</td>', 'too small by half!', '2007-01-08 14:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196297, 445772, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like how you used a black background to further enhance the cliche aspect to this. :P My only issue with this is the lighting. It''s ok but just doesn''t do more to enhance and shape the flower.</td>', 'I like how you used a black background to further enhance the cliche aspect to this. :P My only issue with this is the lighting. It''s ok but just doesn''t do more to enhance and shape the flower.', '2007-01-08 14:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196301, 446428, 70359, '<td valign="top">Great Shot!</td>', 'Great Shot!', '2007-01-08 14:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196306, 445025, 41337, '<td valign="top">I really like how the face fills the frame but the lighting is a bit too much. Maybe either push it further to get a true high key shot or pull back and keep more of the features in tact.</td>', 'I really like how the face fills the frame but the lighting is a bit too much. Maybe either push it further to get a true high key shot or pull back and keep more of the features in tact.', '2007-01-08 14:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196315, 444120, 71499, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, especially the contrast between the rust and the silvery tones. GREAT!</td>', 'Love the colors, especially the contrast between the rust and the silvery tones. GREAT!', '2007-01-08 14:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196320, 443705, 71499, '<td valign="top">I love the setup. How the colors draw your eye to the middle! Very creative, LOVE IT.</td>', 'I love the setup. How the colors draw your eye to the middle! Very creative, LOVE IT.', '2007-01-08 14:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196335, 446588, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good color and lines. A brighter image would have gotten you more mileage with the voters as well as a more centered alignment, IMO. Although the latter may change the dynamic too much. Looks fine as is but just noting what might hold this back some. Good luck.</td>', 'Good color and lines. A brighter image would have gotten you more mileage with the voters as well as a more centered alignment, IMO. Although the latter may change the dynamic too much. Looks fine as is but just noting what might hold this back some. Good luck.', '2007-01-08 14:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196341, 445985, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and color. I''m not crazy about the horizon where it''s positioned but seems to work fine in this composition.</td>', 'Good clarity and color. I''m not crazy about the horizon where it''s positioned but seems to work fine in this composition.', '2007-01-08 14:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196344, 444904, 41337, '<td valign="top">You really lined this up well.</td>', 'You really lined this up well.', '2007-01-08 14:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196347, 446422, 71499, '<td valign="top">I LOVE how the Swan attracts your attention right away, then you can look at the amazing colors behind it in the buildings. LOVE IT!</td>', 'I LOVE how the Swan attracts your attention right away, then you can look at the amazing colors behind it in the buildings. LOVE IT!', '2007-01-08 14:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196350, 443762, 41337, '<td valign="top">Those are some crazy colors but they do compliment the edgy aspect to this subject and composition.</td>', 'Those are some crazy colors but they do compliment the edgy aspect to this subject and composition.', '2007-01-08 14:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196357, 445830, 66515, '<td valign="top">Use the full size of image allowed. With the square crop this just looks that much smaller.</td>', 'Use the full size of image allowed. With the square crop this just looks that much smaller.', '2007-01-08 14:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196359, 446488, 66515, '<td valign="top">Too small!</td>', 'Too small!', '2007-01-08 14:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196364, 443369, 66515, '<td valign="top">Very interesting capture but your submission is too small! Use the full size allowed so we can see what we are trying to vote on!</td>', 'Very interesting capture but your submission is too small! Use the full size allowed so we can see what we are trying to vote on!', '2007-01-08 14:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196387, 443996, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not really crazy about the desat, nice smile however.  :D  Certainly a centered composition.  Good luck.</td>', 'Not really crazy about the desat, nice smile however.  :D  Certainly a centered composition.  Good luck.', '2007-01-08 14:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196390, 446717, 30049, '<td valign="top">Makes me tilt my head back just to look at it.  :D</td>', 'Makes me tilt my head back just to look at it.  :D', '2007-01-08 14:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196395, 446588, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is nearly an optical illusion.  Up or down?  :D</td>', 'This is nearly an optical illusion.  Up or down?  :D', '2007-01-08 14:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196417, 444474, 30049, '<td valign="top">Tough time of day to get a nice, warm, color-saturated shot.  Appears to be mid-day.  Photo is a little fuzzy (not sharp).  Too bad you couldn''t zero in on this bird and get a close-up.  :/  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Tough time of day to get a nice, warm, color-saturated shot.  Appears to be mid-day.  Photo is a little fuzzy (not sharp).  Too bad you couldn''t zero in on this bird and get a close-up.  :/  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-08 14:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196428, 444892, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot.  Perhaps a little more contrast and greater tonal range?  Hard to tell from here.  Good eye to see this and get a shot of it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a cool shot.  Perhaps a little more contrast and greater tonal range?  Hard to tell from here.  Good eye to see this and get a shot of it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-08 14:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196450, 446378, 41337, '<td valign="top">Let me start out with the positives. First, I like the choice in going with backlighting and the second light source is also in a good spot. The composition is centered well and you chose a good angle for your point of view. <br/> <br/>The main thing you need to improve here is controlling the lighting and focusing. Closing the curtains in the background would help diffuse the light making it less harsh as well as making the background less cluttered. The focus also appears to be off (unintentionally) so I''d try to work on getting a wider DOF with the lens you are using (i.e. smaller aperture). I think if you do just that you''ll improve this shot greatly. In post, you may want to sharpen this a bit using whatever software you have available.<br/> <br/>Some other things you may want to try is moving the glasses away from the bottle. I assume this is champagne? If so I''d try and see how I can make the bubbles more interesting. If the glass is away from the bottle and the background uniform I think that would make the bubbles stand out more as well as maybe having a dedicated light source just for that glass position somwhere off to the side or from behind.</td>', 'Let me start out with the positives. First, I like the choice in going with backlighting and the second light source is also in a good spot. The composition is centered well and you chose a good angle for your point of view.  The main thing you need to improve here is controlling the lighting and focusing. Closing the curtains in the background would help diffuse the light making it less harsh as well as making the background less cluttered. The focus also appears to be off (unintentionally) so I''d try to work on getting a wider DOF with the lens you are using (i.e. smaller aperture). I think if you do just that you''ll improve this shot greatly. In post, you may want to sharpen this a bit using whatever software you have available. Some other things you may want to try is moving the glasses away from the bottle. I assume this is champagne? If so I''d try and see how I can make the bubbles more interesting. If the glass is away from the bottle and the background uniform I think that would make the bubbles stand out more as well as maybe having a dedicated light source just for that glass position somwhere off to the side or from behind.', '2007-01-08 15:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196453, 445056, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a great view.  Appears to be some quick (little sloppy) post-processing done here (left area of the upper deck, loading ramp on the right).</td>', 'This is a great view.  Appears to be some quick (little sloppy) post-processing done here (left area of the upper deck, loading ramp on the right).', '2007-01-08 15:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196455, 443762, 70359, '<td valign="top">My Fav Colour....Great Shot!</td>', 'My Fav Colour....Great Shot!', '2007-01-08 15:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196479, 445162, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image.  I like it a lot.  Only thing holding me back on scoring is the photo doesn''t seem to really utilize a centered composition that much.  The ''Reflections'', as titled, are in the bottom left.  The bridge (I think it''s a bridge in the distance) is close to being centered, but still a ways off.  Did you look at this with the top cropped out some and position the bridge dead center (vertically)?  Just a thought.  Great tonal range of B/W here.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very nice image.  I like it a lot.  Only thing holding me back on scoring is the photo doesn''t seem to really utilize a centered composition that much.  The ''Reflections'', as titled, are in the bottom left.  The bridge (I think it''s a bridge in the distance) is close to being centered, but still a ways off.  Did you look at this with the top cropped out some and position the bridge dead center (vertically)?  Just a thought.  Great tonal range of B/W here.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-01-08 15:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196494, 446242, 30049, '<td valign="top">As is, it''s "ok".  Could you get any closer?  I''d imagine there are some great details in that building that would have filled a frame and been easily centered.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'As is, it''s "ok".  Could you get any closer?  I''d imagine there are some great details in that building that would have filled a frame and been easily centered.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-08 15:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196498, 444665, 30049, '<td valign="top">Darn tree anyway.</td>', 'Darn tree anyway.', '2007-01-08 15:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196502, 443762, 66515, '<td valign="top">The post processing makes this appear strange rather than surreal.</td>', 'The post processing makes this appear strange rather than surreal.', '2007-01-08 15:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196511, 443965, 41794, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it was your intention or not but it looks over processed, especially around the eyes and mouth.</td>', 'Not sure if it was your intention or not but it looks over processed, especially around the eyes and mouth.', '2007-01-08 15:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196513, 445737, 67697, '<td valign="top">Perfect title - great close up!</td>', 'Perfect title - great close up!', '2007-01-08 15:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196520, 446706, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a fun find.  With the alignment, you were kind of darned if you do, darned if you don''t.  Horizontally, the bench tilts to the right, as does the low roof line, yet the top of the window is right on.  :D  I like the various textures that are in this.  Did you consider just centering the bench in the frame and losing the top half of the photo?  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a fun find.  With the alignment, you were kind of darned if you do, darned if you don''t.  Horizontally, the bench tilts to the right, as does the low roof line, yet the top of the window is right on.  :D  I like the various textures that are in this.  Did you consider just centering the bench in the frame and losing the top half of the photo?  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-08 15:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196522, 445301, 67697, '<td valign="top">Skiing makes me nervous because of going down hill way too fast.  And this photo reminds me of my personal fear of skiing lol.  Great capture!  Makes me feel like I am goind down hill too.</td>', 'Skiing makes me nervous because of going down hill way too fast.  And this photo reminds me of my personal fear of skiing lol.  Great capture!  Makes me feel like I am goind down hill too.', '2007-01-08 15:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
