(3197181, 444919, 31133, '<td valign="top">Woweeee, what a capture! Amazing photography and processing, both. I''m guessing that the smaller size you needed for dpc doesn''t do this justice. It must be amazing in a large size. I almost wish the frame were thinner so I could see even more of this. Wow. Very nice work.</td>', 'Woweeee, what a capture! Amazing photography and processing, both. I''m guessing that the smaller size you needed for dpc doesn''t do this justice. It must be amazing in a large size. I almost wish the frame were thinner so I could see even more of this. Wow. Very nice work.', '2007-01-08 17:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197193, 445845, 31133, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I thought something was missing. At second glance, or rather, at a longer look, I realize that the fact that this is so minimalistic is just right. The chainlink is almost psychedelic, which makes the perfectly non-psychedelic squirrel sitting there a bit of a shock. Or maybe I''m reading too much into this, heh heh. What I''m trying to say is that I like this very much :-)</td>', 'At first glance, I thought something was missing. At second glance, or rather, at a longer look, I realize that the fact that this is so minimalistic is just right. The chainlink is almost psychedelic, which makes the perfectly non-psychedelic squirrel sitting there a bit of a shock. Or maybe I''m reading too much into this, heh heh. What I''m trying to say is that I like this very much :-)', '2007-01-08 18:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197203, 446636, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! So crisp and clear, with such a great leading arc.</td>', 'Beautiful! So crisp and clear, with such a great leading arc.', '2007-01-08 18:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197365, 446757, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that you''ve chosen a square framing - always makes the centre point stronger: however, it also emphasises the geometry of composition, and the tilted line of the horizon - I know, it''s a slope, it should be tilted - seems out of place in this format. Good thinking otherwise, though.</td>', 'I like the fact that you''ve chosen a square framing - always makes the centre point stronger: however, it also emphasises the geometry of composition, and the tilted line of the horizon - I know, it''s a slope, it should be tilted - seems out of place in this format. Good thinking otherwise, though.', '2007-01-08 18:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197373, 446442, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail - thr touble with the full moon though, by definition, is that the light is very flat, and so there''s no sense of the three-dimensionality of it here.</td>', 'Excellent detail - thr touble with the full moon though, by definition, is that the light is very flat, and so there''s no sense of the three-dimensionality of it here.', '2007-01-08 18:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
