(3199322, 445658, 51722, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous composition.  Great depth of focus - image is nice and crisp where it should be and the lines draw my eye right to the centre marble.  I love everything about it.  Fantastic capture.</td>', 'Gorgeous composition.  Great depth of focus - image is nice and crisp where it should be and the lines draw my eye right to the centre marble.  I love everything about it.  Fantastic capture.', '2007-01-09 09:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199378, 443984, 51722, '<td valign="top">On the whole, the image looks a little flat to me.  I''d like to see the skin tones brightened a little (can be done using curves).  I think a little more contrast would bring out some of the great texture in this image.  The catchlights would be better up in the subject''s irises rather than directly over his pupils. Interesting bokeh, but seeing as it is brighter than the subjects skin, my attention is drawn there even before the selectively coloured eyes.</td>', 'On the whole, the image looks a little flat to me.  I''d like to see the skin tones brightened a little (can be done using curves).  I think a little more contrast would bring out some of the great texture in this image.  The catchlights would be better up in the subject''s irises rather than directly over his pupils. Interesting bokeh, but seeing as it is brighter than the subjects skin, my attention is drawn there even before the selectively coloured eyes.', '2007-01-09 09:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199387, 446210, 51722, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  My eye is drawn to the brighter reflection on the right side of the image rather than the "orb" though.  Perhaps a shallowed depth of focus may have helped bring the central object more to the "forefront" of the image.</td>', 'Interesting image.  My eye is drawn to the brighter reflection on the right side of the image rather than the "orb" though.  Perhaps a shallowed depth of focus may have helped bring the central object more to the "forefront" of the image.', '2007-01-09 09:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199413, 446571, 51722, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous tones and textures in this image.  Seeing as the challenge theme was "centered composition" I would have liked to see more of the wall behind the subjects though - to make them more central in the photo.  Either that, or I would have liked to see the table closer to the camera, with a narrow depth of focus, focused on the tea pot.</td>', 'Gorgeous tones and textures in this image.  Seeing as the challenge theme was "centered composition" I would have liked to see more of the wall behind the subjects though - to make them more central in the photo.  Either that, or I would have liked to see the table closer to the camera, with a narrow depth of focus, focused on the tea pot.', '2007-01-09 09:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199429, 445737, 51722, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Nice centered composition without it screaming "centered".  Perfect focus and beautiful depth of focus.  The image is a little grainy, but I find it adds "gritty" style to an otherwise tranquil photo.  Lovely image.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Nice centered composition without it screaming "centered".  Perfect focus and beautiful depth of focus.  The image is a little grainy, but I find it adds "gritty" style to an otherwise tranquil photo.  Lovely image.  Thanks for sharing.', '2007-01-09 09:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
