(3199902, 445636, 71402, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, the conformity of the palm trees really makes this shot.  I''m just not sure about the "centered" concept.  Verticaly I supose it is....</td>', 'I love the colors, the conformity of the palm trees really makes this shot.  I''m just not sure about the "centered" concept.  Verticaly I supose it is....', '2007-01-09 11:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
