(3199932, 446060, 62626, '<td valign="top">You may have been going for the blue cast, but think it could be improved by contrasting the white stones against the blue sky more.</td>', 'You may have been going for the blue cast, but think it could be improved by contrasting the white stones against the blue sky more.', '2007-01-09 11:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199933, 446210, 71402, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Kinda creative.  I like too the that water is green.  I can''t decide if it helps or hurts that the center of you photo isn''t what is seen first.  A little backwards focus never hurt anyone right?</td>', 'I like this.  Kinda creative.  I like too the that water is green.  I can''t decide if it helps or hurts that the center of you photo isn''t what is seen first.  A little backwards focus never hurt anyone right?', '2007-01-09 11:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199935, 443436, 16062, '<td valign="top">points off for focus problem</td>', 'points off for focus problem', '2007-01-09 11:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199936, 443269, 62626, '<td valign="top">Wow that is one wicked beak!</td>', 'Wow that is one wicked beak!', '2007-01-09 11:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199938, 446227, 71402, '<td valign="top">Wow those are amazing eyes!  I like this.  You know that kitty attitude is really comming through in this one.  The moment has been captured perfectly.</td>', 'Wow those are amazing eyes!  I like this.  You know that kitty attitude is really comming through in this one.  The moment has been captured perfectly.', '2007-01-09 11:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199939, 444265, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot overall.  Has anyone told you yet that your horizon is tilted?  :P  I think the strong leading lines of the water channel and rocks take the viewer off-center some, meaning that this doesn''t feel that centered.  A polarizer may have helped to control that sky a little.<br/> <br/>Now that I look a bit closer I notice some strong haloing around the tree and the upper rocks, yet the photo doesn''t seem oversharpened.  Been playing around with HDR/Tonemapping a little perhaps?  :D<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice shot overall.  Has anyone told you yet that your horizon is tilted?  :P  I think the strong leading lines of the water channel and rocks take the viewer off-center some, meaning that this doesn''t feel that centered.  A polarizer may have helped to control that sky a little. Now that I look a bit closer I notice some strong haloing around the tree and the upper rocks, yet the photo doesn''t seem oversharpened.  Been playing around with HDR/Tonemapping a little perhaps?  :D Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-09 11:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199940, 443725, 62626, '<td valign="top">I like this cat photo, but it is a pretty common composition and therefore does not stand out in this challenge.</td>', 'I like this cat photo, but it is a pretty common composition and therefore does not stand out in this challenge.', '2007-01-09 11:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199941, 443997, 71402, '<td valign="top">Enchanting.  I''m a big fan of this "fairytale" feeling. Is the bridge really centered?</td>', 'Enchanting.  I''m a big fan of this "fairytale" feeling. Is the bridge really centered?', '2007-01-09 11:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199942, 446475, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the dog, but looks a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice capture of the dog, but looks a bit oversharpened.', '2007-01-09 11:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199945, 446546, 71402, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I am a little lost on what it is.  A train?  I think a little more focus would still have driven the point home, maybe more interesting too.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I am a little lost on what it is.  A train?  I think a little more focus would still have driven the point home, maybe more interesting too.', '2007-01-09 11:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199948, 445102, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice pet portrait; would be nice to see both eyes clearly.</td>', 'Nice pet portrait; would be nice to see both eyes clearly.', '2007-01-09 11:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199950, 446734, 71402, '<td valign="top">I like.  Funny song too.  Alot of these are too serious, I really enjoy the sense of humor thrown in.</td>', 'I like.  Funny song too.  Alot of these are too serious, I really enjoy the sense of humor thrown in.', '2007-01-09 11:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3199953, 444373, 16062, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''s putting the main subject in the center.  And, it has a reason to be there.  Great color.  Good job.</td>', 'Now THAT''s putting the main subject in the center.  And, it has a reason to be there.  Great color.  Good job.', '2007-01-09 11:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
