(3199962, 445209, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey!  That''s a pretty cool action shot.  :D  Is that prop wash from a boat passing by on the lower right?<br/> <br/>I''m not a big fan of vignetting, however, this is one case where I think it may help the viewer stay centered in this photo.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hey!  That''s a pretty cool action shot.  :D  Is that prop wash from a boat passing by on the lower right? I''m not a big fan of vignetting, however, this is one case where I think it may help the viewer stay centered in this photo.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-09 11:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
