(3200577, 446692, 30049, '<td valign="top">The top part over the fence is distracting and pulls the viewers attention away from the core subject of this photo.  JMO of course.  On the plus side I like the color saturation and general composition (minus the top of the fence).  :D  Good luck.</td>', 'The top part over the fence is distracting and pulls the viewers attention away from the core subject of this photo.  JMO of course.  On the plus side I like the color saturation and general composition (minus the top of the fence).  :D  Good luck.', '2007-01-09 13:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
