(3200603, 446552, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is very clever and funny.  Good idea for the challenge.  I wish the photo was a little sharper, a little brighter, less noisy, and had a tad more contrast.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Oh, this is very clever and funny.  Good idea for the challenge.  I wish the photo was a little sharper, a little brighter, less noisy, and had a tad more contrast.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-09 14:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
