(3200760, 446713, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice catch here.  Wouldn''t be able to get this in the summer with all the leaves.  Looks like you kept the lighting fairly natural in processing, which works well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice catch here.  Wouldn''t be able to get this in the summer with all the leaves.  Looks like you kept the lighting fairly natural in processing, which works well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-09 14:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200762, 445491, 67258, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - serene and tranquil.  A shame about the noise, but it doesn''t detract substantially from my enjoyment of the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful - serene and tranquil.  A shame about the noise, but it doesn''t detract substantially from my enjoyment of the photo.', '2007-01-09 14:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200765, 443576, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep.  Like it a lot!  Direct and to the point (pun intended).  :D  This should do well for you.  Good luck.</td>', 'Yep.  Like it a lot!  Direct and to the point (pun intended).  :D  This should do well for you.  Good luck.', '2007-01-09 14:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200771, 444012, 30049, '<td valign="top">This feels like a Scalvert.  Creative, clean, simple, and to the point.  Oh, sharp and properly exposed too.  :D  This really is a clever entry.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This feels like a Scalvert.  Creative, clean, simple, and to the point.  Oh, sharp and properly exposed too.  :D  This really is a clever entry.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-09 14:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200775, 444451, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love this color combination (blue, black, grey).  Good eye to see this and capture it for the challenge.  This probably has some stock value as well.  Didn''t it drive you nuts to leave that extra space up top to center this?  :D<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love this color combination (blue, black, grey).  Good eye to see this and capture it for the challenge.  This probably has some stock value as well.  Didn''t it drive you nuts to leave that extra space up top to center this?  :D Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-09 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200782, 444583, 30049, '<td valign="top">What wonderful character you''ve captured here.  The title works well, although I imagine there are multiple others you could plug in.  :D  Those EARS!?  Is this cat part Lynx or something?  He-he.<br/> <br/>Anyway - job well done (technicals, blah-blah-blah).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What wonderful character you''ve captured here.  The title works well, although I imagine there are multiple others you could plug in.  :D  Those EARS!?  Is this cat part Lynx or something?  He-he. Anyway - job well done (technicals, blah-blah-blah).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-09 15:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200789, 446507, 30049, '<td valign="top">I hope this doesn''t fall into the "underrated" forum threads after all is said and done.  You did a nice job of seeing this.  Post-processing is good, although it''s hard not to notice the vignette burning (it is snow after all).  :D  Good luck.</td>', 'I hope this doesn''t fall into the "underrated" forum threads after all is said and done.  You did a nice job of seeing this.  Post-processing is good, although it''s hard not to notice the vignette burning (it is snow after all).  :D  Good luck.', '2007-01-09 15:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200799, 443894, 30049, '<td valign="top">Title matches perfectly!  I can almost see the bird lifting it''s wing while saying it.  :D  Oh, yeah...nice photo too BTW.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Title matches perfectly!  I can almost see the bird lifting it''s wing while saying it.  :D  Oh, yeah...nice photo too BTW.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-09 15:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200807, 446571, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like the tone applied here in post-processing.  Works very well for the subject matter and general feel of the photo.  I''m a little torn on how to score this as I don''t really consider this to be that centered.  The girl and the woman are pulling alot of interest to the outside of the photo.  Let''s just say it fell into my top 20 picks.  :D  Well done overall.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the tone applied here in post-processing.  Works very well for the subject matter and general feel of the photo.  I''m a little torn on how to score this as I don''t really consider this to be that centered.  The girl and the woman are pulling alot of interest to the outside of the photo.  Let''s just say it fell into my top 20 picks.  :D  Well done overall.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-09 15:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200829, 446731, 42495, '<td valign="top">Love the shades of gray and simple composition.</td>', 'Love the shades of gray and simple composition.', '2007-01-09 15:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200865, 446325, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, good color.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, good color.', '2007-01-09 15:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200960, 445737, 68528, '<td valign="top">good pic</td>', 'good pic', '2007-01-09 15:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201011, 446344, 33400, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of light and color.  Some may not like this because you apparently used colored lights on nature, But I think it''s a beautiful blending of bright colors and the natural calm of the wheat.<br/>Congratulations on a great photo.</td>', 'Beautiful use of light and color.  Some may not like this because you apparently used colored lights on nature, But I think it''s a beautiful blending of bright colors and the natural calm of the wheat.Congratulations on a great photo.', '2007-01-09 16:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201020, 445856, 8776, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most peaceful pictures I have ever seen.</td>', 'This is one of the most peaceful pictures I have ever seen.', '2007-01-09 16:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201029, 444304, 6999, '<td valign="top">Given that nose, how about a square aspect ratio? The extreme wide-angle is fun, but I wonder if that mightn''t have been more fun still ...</td>', 'Given that nose, how about a square aspect ratio? The extreme wide-angle is fun, but I wonder if that mightn''t have been more fun still ...', '2007-01-09 16:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201030, 444890, 66201, '<td valign="top">Fascinating and powerful. A photo full of drama and rich story. The duotone works well.9</td>', 'Fascinating and powerful. A photo full of drama and rich story. The duotone works well.9', '2007-01-09 16:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201031, 445140, 66201, '<td valign="top">Lovely clarity and treatment of colour.8</td>', 'Lovely clarity and treatment of colour.8', '2007-01-09 16:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201032, 446386, 8776, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful.  How you were able to get just the right shot!</td>', 'This is so beautiful.  How you were able to get just the right shot!', '2007-01-09 16:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201033, 445112, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite frightening; a touch more pondering on composition might well have paid off.</td>', 'Quite frightening; a touch more pondering on composition might well have paid off.', '2007-01-09 16:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201036, 445496, 8776, '<td valign="top">What an eye for detail!</td>', 'What an eye for detail!', '2007-01-09 16:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201039, 446473, 66201, '<td valign="top">I love the subtlety of the centred subject in this. The eye is drawn relentlessly to the centre, by a seemingly insignificant subject. The red works brilliantly.</td>', 'I love the subtlety of the centred subject in this. The eye is drawn relentlessly to the centre, by a seemingly insignificant subject. The red works brilliantly.', '2007-01-09 16:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201045, 444524, 6999, '<td valign="top">Neat. Perhaps filling the frame might have made for more impact? Might have emphasised that wrap-around of the body more? I wonder if it''s a touch over-exposed as well - I yearn for some deeper darkness here.</td>', 'Neat. Perhaps filling the frame might have made for more impact? Might have emphasised that wrap-around of the body more? I wonder if it''s a touch over-exposed as well - I yearn for some deeper darkness here.', '2007-01-09 16:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201046, 446762, 8776, '<td valign="top">I love the color!</td>', 'I love the color!', '2007-01-09 16:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201048, 445178, 6999, '<td valign="top">A centred composition, it seems to me, depends a great deal on real regularity of composition to work well; the off-set of that background light disrupts that, and your negative space to the edges of frame don''t seem everso useful.</td>', 'A centred composition, it seems to me, depends a great deal on real regularity of composition to work well; the off-set of that background light disrupts that, and your negative space to the edges of frame don''t seem everso useful.', '2007-01-09 16:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201049, 444499, 6999, '<td valign="top">Just too weird, perhaps?</td>', 'Just too weird, perhaps?', '2007-01-09 16:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201050, 446734, 8776, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Good eye!</td>', 'Cute!  Good eye!', '2007-01-09 16:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201053, 446168, 8776, '<td valign="top">I love the vibrant color</td>', 'I love the vibrant color', '2007-01-09 16:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201055, 445496, 6999, '<td valign="top">Marvellous detail and technicals. I''m unsure about including the horizon - unneccesary complication to a simple composition?</td>', 'Marvellous detail and technicals. I''m unsure about including the horizon - unneccesary complication to a simple composition?', '2007-01-09 16:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201057, 446361, 6999, '<td valign="top">Love these animals: chickens with trousers.</td>', 'Love these animals: chickens with trousers.', '2007-01-09 16:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201062, 443578, 6999, '<td valign="top">Are you sure about the balance of those lines within frame? And the tilt to the overall image? I can''t myself see a use for it, and it draws the attention away from the composition into a working-out of what it is that feels wrong.</td>', 'Are you sure about the balance of those lines within frame? And the tilt to the overall image? I can''t myself see a use for it, and it draws the attention away from the composition into a working-out of what it is that feels wrong.', '2007-01-09 16:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201068, 446060, 6999, '<td valign="top">Seems to lack decent contrast; no blacks, and the emphasis of shapes would require that to my eye. In general, its over-exposed, which removes the impact of the colours from the image.</td>', 'Seems to lack decent contrast; no blacks, and the emphasis of shapes would require that to my eye. In general, its over-exposed, which removes the impact of the colours from the image.', '2007-01-09 16:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201075, 446277, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, but technically not centered.</td>', 'Very nice shot, but technically not centered.', '2007-01-09 16:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201120, 446151, 69733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2007-01-09 16:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201125, 445845, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very interesting approach to the challenge: disturbed only by the suspicion that it isn''t absolutely centred. That''s not a a ''does not meet challenge'' comment beloved of the masses - but in a composition that relies entirely on the graphic, as this silhouette does, the absolute balance of that geometry has so much more importance. I think this should be cropped square, and the squirrel lowered and moved right a touch in frame. That could all be an optical illusion though, but I suspect not ...</td>', 'Very interesting approach to the challenge: disturbed only by the suspicion that it isn''t absolutely centred. That''s not a a ''does not meet challenge'' comment beloved of the masses - but in a composition that relies entirely on the graphic, as this silhouette does, the absolute balance of that geometry has so much more importance. I think this should be cropped square, and the squirrel lowered and moved right a touch in frame. That could all be an optical illusion though, but I suspect not ...', '2007-01-09 16:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201134, 444900, 32644, '<td valign="top">Good catch but not sharp enough IMHO.</td>', 'Good catch but not sharp enough IMHO.', '2007-01-09 16:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201135, 446519, 55767, '<td valign="top">another great moon shot!</td>', 'another great moon shot!', '2007-01-09 16:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201143, 446277, 63588, '<td valign="top">I love this image. The lighting is really neat but I wouldn''t consider this "centered"</td>', 'I love this image. The lighting is really neat but I wouldn''t consider this "centered"', '2007-01-09 16:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201148, 446273, 31606, '<td valign="top">One of my top 3.  "10"</td>', 'One of my top 3.  "10"', '2007-01-09 16:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201151, 443631, 31606, '<td valign="top">One of my top 3.  The lighting is perfect.  "10"</td>', 'One of my top 3.  The lighting is perfect.  "10"', '2007-01-09 16:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201152, 446637, 31606, '<td valign="top">Best in this challenge.  I see blue for you.  "10"</td>', 'Best in this challenge.  I see blue for you.  "10"', '2007-01-09 16:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201155, 444438, 32644, '<td valign="top">I feel this would have been a more powerfull shot if you had left it original. It looks like it was taken at night, indoors, so maybe not. The way it is I had to look long and hard to figure out it was a snowboarder.</td>', 'I feel this would have been a more powerfull shot if you had left it original. It looks like it was taken at night, indoors, so maybe not. The way it is I had to look long and hard to figure out it was a snowboarder.', '2007-01-09 16:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201160, 445139, 31606, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Reminds me of a self portrait by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=55642" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">karmabreeze</a> <br/> <br/>"9"</td>', 'Very nice image.  Reminds me of a self portrait by  karmabreeze  "9"', '2007-01-09 16:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201162, 446699, 32644, '<td valign="top">This would have been a very nice perspective shot if something was in focus.</td>', 'This would have been a very nice perspective shot if something was in focus.', '2007-01-09 16:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201164, 445022, 31606, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the blue and red is great and the lighting is perfect. "9"</td>', 'The contrast of the blue and red is great and the lighting is perfect. "9"', '2007-01-09 16:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201173, 446078, 32644, '<td valign="top">This is a nice close-up of these leaves but a bit too dark.</td>', 'This is a nice close-up of these leaves but a bit too dark.', '2007-01-09 16:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201178, 443664, 32644, '<td valign="top">This looks like a beautiful place. Your submission is too small to tell if it is a good shot. Sorry.</td>', 'This looks like a beautiful place. Your submission is too small to tell if it is a good shot. Sorry.', '2007-01-09 16:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201181, 446488, 32644, '<td valign="top">This looks like you had fun taking this shot. Your submission is too small to see if it was a good shot. Sorry</td>', 'This looks like you had fun taking this shot. Your submission is too small to see if it was a good shot. Sorry', '2007-01-09 16:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201185, 445178, 32644, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a beautiful shot if there was a little more light on her face and hands.</td>', 'I think this would have been a beautiful shot if there was a little more light on her face and hands.', '2007-01-09 16:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201187, 445707, 32644, '<td valign="top">Interesting treatment.</td>', 'Interesting treatment.', '2007-01-09 16:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201190, 446488, 63588, '<td valign="top">Great idea but needs to be bigger.</td>', 'Great idea but needs to be bigger.', '2007-01-09 16:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201194, 446409, 31133, '<td valign="top">I really like the horse and rider! Nice colors in the sky, too.</td>', 'I really like the horse and rider! Nice colors in the sky, too.', '2007-01-09 16:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201202, 443938, 31133, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective and straightforwardness of this shot. I''d love to see this with just the guy and the road, and no people or cars at the bottom of the hill.</td>', 'Love the perspective and straightforwardness of this shot. I''d love to see this with just the guy and the road, and no people or cars at the bottom of the hill.', '2007-01-09 17:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201203, 446760, 69604, '<td valign="top">yes really weird</td>', 'yes really weird', '2007-01-09 17:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201226, 443587, 63588, '<td valign="top">Would be much better if there wasn''t the building in the background that was similar in color to the dog.</td>', 'Would be much better if there wasn''t the building in the background that was similar in color to the dog.', '2007-01-09 17:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201254, 445708, 36040, '<td valign="top">I think this might have looked nice had it just been a straight shot. I definitely would have gotten.</td>', 'I think this might have looked nice had it just been a straight shot. I definitely would have gotten.', '2007-01-09 17:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201338, 446602, 71268, '<td valign="top">OK looks good, big big chair makes the girl/woman tiny, but makes the composition.</td>', 'OK looks good, big big chair makes the girl/woman tiny, but makes the composition.', '2007-01-09 17:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201339, 445022, 71268, '<td valign="top">Great composition and balance, well crafted together. Fits the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'Great composition and balance, well crafted together. Fits the challenge perfectly.', '2007-01-09 17:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201450, 445218, 68504, '<td valign="top">Got it. Fine design and balanced composition, but what I really like are the polished shoes and the clear reflection - good centre draw.</td>', 'Got it. Fine design and balanced composition, but what I really like are the polished shoes and the clear reflection - good centre draw.', '2007-01-09 18:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201466, 446552, 68504, '<td valign="top">Fun. Good treatment of fore versus back ground, balanced buoys, and you really have me wondering...</td>', 'Fun. Good treatment of fore versus back ground, balanced buoys, and you really have me wondering...', '2007-01-09 18:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201478, 446606, 68504, '<td valign="top">Good light and colour (red!), and smoke trail and ground texture. (Fringing on silhouette slight drawback).</td>', 'Good light and colour (red!), and smoke trail and ground texture. (Fringing on silhouette slight drawback).', '2007-01-09 18:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201514, 446352, 68504, '<td valign="top">Really nice treatment of the colours, and the positioning of flower versus vase provides tension.  Red flowers are hard to photograph, and this is well done too, showing just enough variation to offset the smooth blurred vase.</td>', 'Really nice treatment of the colours, and the positioning of flower versus vase provides tension.  Red flowers are hard to photograph, and this is well done too, showing just enough variation to offset the smooth blurred vase.', '2007-01-09 18:40:56.000000', NULL, 1);
