(3201530, 444981, 68504, '<td valign="top">Fabulous blue and feather textures.  The background doesn''t show the peacock''s outline and plumage to the advantage they deserve - mabe blur, colour transformation?</td>', 'Fabulous blue and feather textures.  The background doesn''t show the peacock''s outline and plumage to the advantage they deserve - mabe blur, colour transformation?', '2007-01-09 18:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
