(3202821, 446745, 20115, '<td valign="top">This is actually a small 4 inch black cut out of a person in a yoga position.  I placed it on my kitchen table and then used my little bike light to light it from behind between the table and the canvas backdrop.  I actually took several shots of just the figure but then liked the incense burner too.  Probably should have just had the figure with the light as many commented.  I wanted to do this idea but did not have any one to pose for me nor do I have studio space, so I improvised.</td>', 'This is actually a small 4 inch black cut out of a person in a yoga position.  I placed it on my kitchen table and then used my little bike light to light it from behind between the table and the canvas backdrop.  I actually took several shots of just the figure but then liked the incense burner too.  Probably should have just had the figure with the light as many commented.  I wanted to do this idea but did not have any one to pose for me nor do I have studio space, so I improvised.', '2007-01-10 00:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
