(3203294, 446766, 48471, '<td valign="top">Yes, a mistake, but I can´t say what is wrong. I feel some hand shaking, my eyes are pushed to the top right angle, maybe because of the light. Compositionally this is perfect, I think, and the thick border is a great idea. But, there´s just something wrong with the focus and light here...I don´t know, but it never made me go for more than a 5 here.<br/> <br/>Looking forward to see you in the other challenges.</td>', 'Yes, a mistake, but I can´t say what is wrong. I feel some hand shaking, my eyes are pushed to the top right angle, maybe because of the light. Compositionally this is perfect, I think, and the thick border is a great idea. But, there´s just something wrong with the focus and light here...I don´t know, but it never made me go for more than a 5 here. Looking forward to see you in the other challenges.', '2007-01-10 01:02:45.000000', NULL, 0),
