(3203409, 446636, 31133, '<td valign="top">Well, this was a strange discovery for me ... I gave this a 10 and disagree with most of the comments you received. Really baffled at the average score here and the lukewarm reaction. For some reason, this image really got to me - I think it''s great! So you get a big congratulations from me, even if you''re placement in the challenge isn''t what either one of us would''ve hoped :-)</td>', 'Well, this was a strange discovery for me ... I gave this a 10 and disagree with most of the comments you received. Really baffled at the average score here and the lukewarm reaction. For some reason, this image really got to me - I think it''s great! So you get a big congratulations from me, even if you''re placement in the challenge isn''t what either one of us would''ve hoped :-)', '2007-01-10 01:17:14.000000', NULL, 0),
