(3204149, 446459, 48471, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by eyeofmymind:</b></div><hr/><i> Where are the car keys?  Its too dark. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>They´re on the hand of the man outside, see, the guy out there opening the door of the car, look through the door of the shop.<br/> <br/>The title of this photo seemed like a U2 lyric to me.</td>', 'Originally posted by eyeofmymind: Where are the car keys?  Its too dark.   They´re on the hand of the man outside, see, the guy out there opening the door of the car, look through the door of the shop. The title of this photo seemed like a U2 lyric to me.', '2007-01-10 04:47:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3204166, 446215, 57936, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments folks. For those that questioned the centeredness of this picture, the "Subject" of the picture is the piece of drinking straw that is stuck in the nostrils of the poor goose. this is what drew my attention and why I took the picture in the first place, hence it is the "Subject" of the picture. That straw is smack-dab in the center of the photo. Measure it if you would like! :)<br/></td>', 'Thanks for the comments folks. For those that questioned the centeredness of this picture, the "Subject" of the picture is the piece of drinking straw that is stuck in the nostrils of the poor goose. this is what drew my attention and why I took the picture in the first place, hence it is the "Subject" of the picture. That straw is smack-dab in the center of the photo. Measure it if you would like! :)', '2007-01-10 04:52:35.000000', NULL, 0),
