(3204341, 444047, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7.  Really liked this, especially the good composition and matching colors or ''Calico''.  Even though works well ''as is'', in my opinion - I do/did wonder about the cat in focus too, which was the main reason I didn''t go higher.  Good capture though - and you may not have had ''long enough'' to adjust the focus and still get this look.  <i>edit: to add score (forgot to mention)</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-10 05:46:47.</i></td>', 'I gave this a 7.  Really liked this, especially the good composition and matching colors or ''Calico''.  Even though works well ''as is'', in my opinion - I do/did wonder about the cat in focus too, which was the main reason I didn''t go higher.  Good capture though - and you may not have had ''long enough'' to adjust the focus and still get this look.  edit: to add score (forgot to mention)', '2007-01-10 05:45:28.000000', '2007-01-10 05:46:47.000000', 0),
(3204354, 444285, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6.  Liked it, but thought a nudge rotate up on the right to straighten and just a slightly more refined crop, would have made it even better, in my opinion.  Thought it was a good image for this Challenge, but hard to appreciate at this size, due to the ''medium''.</td>', 'I gave this a 6.  Liked it, but thought a nudge rotate up on the right to straighten and just a slightly more refined crop, would have made it even better, in my opinion.  Thought it was a good image for this Challenge, but hard to appreciate at this size, due to the ''medium''.', '2007-01-10 05:56:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3204370, 446459, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6.  Good use of your title, made me study this image longer - and I ''found the car keys''.  The darkness suits this image well, as does the centered composition.  A good ''candid'' style shot with some character and interest thrown in.</td>', 'I gave this a 6.  Good use of your title, made me study this image longer - and I ''found the car keys''.  The darkness suits this image well, as does the centered composition.  A good ''candid'' style shot with some character and interest thrown in.', '2007-01-10 06:00:10.000000', NULL, 0),
