(3205074, 444393, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tamatama:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> ...of?<br/> <br/>I like the silhouettes of the trees.  The green sky is a little awkward.  Good luck in the challenge. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Of the first ever atomic bomb thrown above this place 1945. Hiroshima!<br/> <br/>Thought it was recognizable.... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hi.  Nothing personal, I really didn''t recognize this location, still don''t actually.  Has this building been published internationally or something that I''m not aware of?  From my perspective it looked like either something under construction, or a shell of a building left from a fire (guess I was fairly close on the second thought).<br/> <br/>Thanks for sharing the story on this.</td>', 'Originally posted by tamatama: Originally posted by glad2badad: ...of? I like the silhouettes of the trees.  The green sky is a little awkward.  Good luck in the challenge.   Of the first ever atomic bomb thrown above this place 1945. Hiroshima! Thought it was recognizable....  Hi.  Nothing personal, I really didn''t recognize this location, still don''t actually.  Has this building been published internationally or something that I''m not aware of?  From my perspective it looked like either something under construction, or a shell of a building left from a fire (guess I was fairly close on the second thought). Thanks for sharing the story on this.', '2007-01-10 09:06:05.000000', NULL, 0),
