(3205462, 445844, 66384, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7 because I like the rich browns, the pattern of the cross and the "button" in the center. I think it needs to be rotated ever so slightly counter-clockwise, perhaps .5 degrees. That bothers me. Also I agree with Bob that the door is a problem. I don''t mind the recessed area and shadow, but the door handle spoils the simplicity of the composition.</td>', 'I gave this a 7 because I like the rich browns, the pattern of the cross and the "button" in the center. I think it needs to be rotated ever so slightly counter-clockwise, perhaps .5 degrees. That bothers me. Also I agree with Bob that the door is a problem. I don''t mind the recessed area and shadow, but the door handle spoils the simplicity of the composition.', '2007-01-10 10:06:49.000000', NULL, 0),
