(3207695, 446734, 58845, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who voted and left comments!  I hadn''t noticed the ''green stuff'' below This, the fish.  Thanks for pointing that out.  I was   so involved with taking out ''other'' distractions (see original  //www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php). I don''t yet know how to change a good composition into a great photo.  I would welcome comments and tips on how I ''could'' have treated this photo. I couldn''t visualize it any way but ''green''.  Didn''t know how to get more color without more noise. How does one fix ''<i>flat</i>''?  Thanks for those tips!  A bit about the fish.  His name is ''This'' and he''s the most awesome fish I have ever owned.  He loves to be petted and if he had the means, he would follow me around the house.  He is more interested in what is outside the tank than inside.  He keeps his eye on us.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who voted and left comments!  I hadn''t noticed the ''green stuff'' below This, the fish.  Thanks for pointing that out.  I was   so involved with taking out ''other'' distractions (see original  //www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php). I don''t yet know how to change a good composition into a great photo.  I would welcome comments and tips on how I ''could'' have treated this photo. I couldn''t visualize it any way but ''green''.  Didn''t know how to get more color without more noise. How does one fix ''flat''?  Thanks for those tips!  A bit about the fish.  His name is ''This'' and he''s the most awesome fish I have ever owned.  He loves to be petted and if he had the means, he would follow me around the house.  He is more interested in what is outside the tank than inside.  He keeps his eye on us.', '2007-01-10 16:25:48.000000', NULL, 0),
