(3287216, 446748, 29011, '<td valign="top">This is a very fine shot, the lighting, composition and colors are very pleasing. But for this challenge the composition isn''t optimal. The plate is centered as is the group of tangerines but the focal point leads us astray. If the cut in half tangerine was in the middle of the shot then I would think this would''ve scored better for this particular challenge. But out of challenge this shot works really well.</td>', 'This is a very fine shot, the lighting, composition and colors are very pleasing. But for this challenge the composition isn''t optimal. The plate is centered as is the group of tangerines but the focal point leads us astray. If the cut in half tangerine was in the middle of the shot then I would think this would''ve scored better for this particular challenge. But out of challenge this shot works really well.', '2007-01-26 14:05:54.000000', NULL, 0),
