(4029086, 445139, 47483, '<td valign="top">This is one very good photo. I have been looking for some centered compositions. <br/>Reason: I wish to write a note about compositions. I have been seeing people writing that centered compositions are boring, rule to 2/3 etc etc. I feel there is no rule about compositions, its just what we feel would work best for the subject. <br/>This one is good example.</td>', 'This is one very good photo. I have been looking for some centered compositions. Reason: I wish to write a note about compositions. I have been seeing people writing that centered compositions are boring, rule to 2/3 etc etc. I feel there is no rule about compositions, its just what we feel would work best for the subject. This one is good example.', '2007-08-25 23:45:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4029647, 445022, 43463, '<td valign="top">This is a very striking image. Love the colors and shapes in this photo. The white hues of the plate really complement and make the red shades bolder and vibrant. Love how you have a three-tiered circle shape stacked up - the white plate, the white bowl and then the red flower. These three circles are stacked within a square format photo - the square format works here because not only does it introduce another shape but it keeps the eye squarely &amp; tightly focused on the main subjects of the photograph. Well done!</td>', 'This is a very striking image. Love the colors and shapes in this photo. The white hues of the plate really complement and make the red shades bolder and vibrant. Love how you have a three-tiered circle shape stacked up - the white plate, the white bowl and then the red flower. These three circles are stacked within a square format photo - the square format works here because not only does it introduce another shape but it keeps the eye squarely & tightly focused on the main subjects of the photograph. Well done!', '2007-08-26 10:00:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4042170, 446699, 75153, '<td valign="top">i would have really liked this one if it were in focus, you should go back and find the same tree and see if you can get it again but in focus.</td>', 'i would have really liked this one if it were in focus, you should go back and find the same tree and see if you can get it again but in focus.', '2007-08-30 17:37:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4084988, 444444, 22301, '<td valign="top">I think using a flash would have brought little light to the eye and may have helped, I like the crop.</td>', 'I think using a flash would have brought little light to the eye and may have helped, I like the crop.', '2007-09-12 16:47:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4162323, 444890, 38127, '<td valign="top">This is the photo that stood out in my memory when I spoke with you yesterday.  I''m so glad you took the time to capture her so beautifully Alex.  I love what E301 had to say about it.. its a real photo that doesnt try to hide anything about who she was...but its not without love.. there is emotion and I hope you frame this one. <br/>Again.. sorry for your loss hun.<br/> <br/>xx <br/>Roz</td>', 'This is the photo that stood out in my memory when I spoke with you yesterday.  I''m so glad you took the time to capture her so beautifully Alex.  I love what E301 had to say about it.. its a real photo that doesnt try to hide anything about who she was...but its not without love.. there is emotion and I hope you frame this one. Again.. sorry for your loss hun. xx Roz', '2007-10-12 09:36:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4265952, 446459, 63269, '<td valign="top">I really like the shadowy lighting here... the tones are fabulous. I wonder how it would look with that light cropped off the top of the photo? Neat shot!</td>', 'I really like the shadowy lighting here... the tones are fabulous. I wonder how it would look with that light cropped off the top of the photo? Neat shot!', '2007-11-23 15:31:51.000000', NULL, 0),
