(5156650, 443381, 100385, '<td valign="top">A great shot which tells a story, you''ve seemed to have captured Larry''s character perfectly. Well done.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-29 15:49:40.</i></td>', 'A great shot which tells a story, you''ve seemed to have captured Larry''s character perfectly. Well done.', '2008-12-29 15:49:24.000000', '2008-12-29 15:49:40.000000', 0),
(5156691, 443381, 30982, '<td valign="top">Screw the score, this is a great portrait.  Not only does it seem to capture the man and his environment perfectly, it''s a very interesting and well done photograph on its own.  I love the customer in the mirror and the cracked back of the chair.  It''s all so very real and very enjoyable!</td>', 'Screw the score, this is a great portrait.  Not only does it seem to capture the man and his environment perfectly, it''s a very interesting and well done photograph on its own.  I love the customer in the mirror and the cracked back of the chair.  It''s all so very real and very enjoyable!', '2008-12-29 16:15:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5157148, 443381, 41337, '<td valign="top">Now this is a wonderful and rich portrait. As Deb mentioned all the little details is what makes this so real and so honest. Had this been shot in a typical studio setting all would have been lost. The idea of him would have been the only thing captured.</td>', 'Now this is a wonderful and rich portrait. As Deb mentioned all the little details is what makes this so real and so honest. Had this been shot in a typical studio setting all would have been lost. The idea of him would have been the only thing captured.', '2008-12-29 22:24:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5157155, 443381, 48560, '<td valign="top">this is a GREAT portrait. the environment captured his working place immediately tells us the story of this man. Although I think it did pretty well in the challenge, i''d like to say that, the score on DPC does not say everything about the value of a photograph besides being "pleasing" to the voters.</td>', 'this is a GREAT portrait. the environment captured his working place immediately tells us the story of this man. Although I think it did pretty well in the challenge, i''d like to say that, the score on DPC does not say everything about the value of a photograph besides being "pleasing" to the voters.', '2008-12-29 22:29:23.000000', NULL, 0),
